# ============================================================
# 大文件资产一律不进 Git
# GitHub 单文件硬上限 100MB（超 50MB 告警），本目录下多为 GB 级
# 比赛素材且可重新下载。队友/新机器请从官方资料重新获取，
# 不要用 git add -f 强行加入（进历史后极难清理）。
# ============================================================

# --- competition release archives (local keep only) ---
# pp_train_data.zip  ~680MB   乒乓球训练集
# bb_train_data.zip  ~4.9GB   篮球训练集
# sport-base_v1.tar  ~23.8GB  基础镜像，仅"方式二 本地Docker提交"需要
# no leading slash on purpose: a leading slash would anchor to repo root,
# but these archives live in the pppp/ subdirectory.
*_train_data.zip
pp_train_data.zip
bb_train_data.zip
sport-base*.tar
pp_train_data/
bb_train_data/

# --- public validation videos (218MB, fetch separately) ---
participant/*/public_data/videos/
participant/*/public_data/**/*.mp4

# --- duplicated nested extraction (restore from participant.zip) ---
participant/participant/

# --- self-test output / caches ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
out/
out_check_solution/
trt_cache/
*.engine
*.plan

# --- trained weights are experiment artifacts, not source ---
# built-in reference weights stay tracked (ball.onnx / player.onnx)
participant/*/participant/weights/*.pth
participant/*/participant/weights/*.pt
participant/*/participant/weights/*.engine
participant/*/participant/models/*.onnx

# --- packaged submissions (docker save output) ---
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# --- 本地评测启动器（开发用，不进仓库）---
# tune_eval.py 本身是要跟踪的；pp_eval.cmd 只是本机调用它的包装
pp_eval.cmd
pp_eval.ps1

# --- 个人/隐私文档一律不进 Git ---
# 本仓库是公开的。实际踩到过：仓库根出现过学生资助名单 xlsx
# （附件4-...国家助学金拟推荐名单...）。当时它未被任何规则覆盖，
# 一旦有人执行 git add -A 就会推到公开仓库，属于真实隐私泄漏。
# 本仓库不该有任何表格/文档产物，故按扩展名整体挡掉。
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.pdf
# 兜底：文件名含这些词的本地材料
*名单*
*拟推荐*
*附件*

# --- editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
